From 12f526073d2a74848f41b426451515a4959b8958 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: T <t@d.local>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 20:55:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Items 1-3 and 13-15. Item 1: every read/write resolves inside
 --out - S3B's legacy discovery_results/ and dots_results/ fallbacks deleted,
 _find_outputs reads the run tree only, F13's RESULTS_DIR exported to the run
 tree. Item 2: S4's glob and _find_outputs both skip any *_part*.csv, and F1's
 F1_part*.csv pattern is dropped. Item 3: split_tree() and --chunk-mb deleted,
 every artifact writes as one file. Item 13: /n_signals_d removed from the
 DepthYield objective and retained as the reported column
 depth_yield_per_signal, which never gates inclusion. Item 14: the _sel_con
 stub deleted; the admission loop is explicitly unconstrained and the
 constraint machinery moves to item 16. Item 15: no selected-book file is
 written in discover-fresh at all - the write is gone, the top-50 baseline
 sort is deleted with it, greedy_direction survives in memory only as item
 12's dilution-curve admission loop, and S8's discover-fresh arm refuses with
 a message pointing at score_book.py while the FROZEN path is untouched.

